--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
INDEPENDENT WORK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Algorandscout is an original work. It contains no third-party explorer source
code, vendors none, and links none. Its only runtime dependencies are aiohttp
and, for the service, FastAPI and uvicorn.

Its REST layout follows conventions common to blockchain explorer APIs so that
existing tooling interoperates. Interface convention is not derivation, in the
same sense that a program which reads a documented file format is not a
derivative of the program that writes it.

Where Algorand's data model and a generic explorer model disagree, Algorand
governs. Concepts the chain does not have are reported as absent and explained
at /api/v2/capabilities, rather than emulated.

No affiliation with, sponsorship by, or endorsement from any other explorer
project or its maintainers is claimed or implied.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
UPSTREAM SERVICES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Algorandscout reads public Algorand infrastructure and bundles none of it:

  * Algorand algod and indexer REST APIs — Algorand Foundation / Algorand
    Technologies. https://developer.algorand.org
  * Default public endpoints: AlgoNode (https://algonode.io), keyless.
    Configurable via ALGORAND_ALGOD_URL / ALGORAND_INDEXER_URL, or derived from
    ALGORAND_NETWORK.

